    "source": "All SQL statements use the canonical single-layer AnalysisBundle, physical source schemas and closed-world PhysicalScriptCatalog",
    "transaction": "One active DuckDB transaction; BEGIN snapshots the typed catalog, COMMIT retains writes, ROLLBACK restores the entire catalog including schema and duplicates",
    "domains": "Signed integer and SQL NULL physical value frequencies provide exact inclusive point bounds; an empty bag has an exact empty domain",
    "proof": "Exact requires source-complete canonical graph and matching full typed checkpoints; contradictory controls are Impossible; unsupported/session or engine dependent semantics are Residual",
    "assumptions": "Single DuckDB connection with no external concurrency, identity sequences, triggers, vendor pragmas or side effects"
  },
